<p. 1a> oṃ namaḥ śivāya ||

samastasiddhāṃtasudhāsamudrasaṃplāvanāyeṃdukarābhirāmāḥ 
jayaṃti vāco bhuvi rāmakaṃṭhabhaṭṭasya vidyeśvaratulyamūrtteḥ |

tato vāptaḥ śrutaścaiva jñānaratnavidhānataḥ |
bhāvacūḍābhidaṃ vakṣye vidyākaṃṭhaśca saṃgraham || 

iha hi pūrvabhagavataḥ svayaṃbhuvaḥ sākṣācchipyena mayena yathā yaśca 
śivārādhanādāvupāyo munibhyaḥ kathitastathā tacchiṣyaḥ svaśiṣyebhyaḥ 
kathayati | 

pṛṣṭhe himavat | 

ityādyena himālayasyāgradeśe pādasamīpe sthitā munayaḥ mayamupaviṣṭaṃ 
dṛṣṭaṃvaṃtaḥ | iti prakriyā darśanāya sṛṣṭopi śloko vyākhyātaḥ |
 
vetāraṃ sarvavidyānām iti || 

caturdaśavidyāsthānajñam caturdaśavidyasthānāniḥ 
purāṇasmṛtimīmāṃsadharmaśāstrāṃgamiśritāḥ vedāḥ sthānāni 
vidyānāṃ dharmasya ca caturdaśetiḥ sarvāṇi śilpāni kalākauśala 
viṣeśāsteṣāṃ pravarttakam | anenāsya viśvakarmatvam | śivaikāhita cetaskaṃ 
paramamāheśvaram | bhaktānugraha tatparamitiḥ | anyeṣāmapi guruṃ 
prabodharocirbhiriti śrutapāṭhābhyāṃ tejoyuktairharṣavyāpyākulekṣaṇā iti | 
anenānumita śaktipātāḥ śraddhādamādibhirātyasaṃskāraiḥ 
śobhāyuktānsatānāhetyādi | śāstrāvatārakaṃ bhagavaṃtaṃ 
śrīkaṃṭhanāthaṃ namaskṛtya sa viśvakarmā tān marīcyādīnityāha | deva 
devasya yajanaṃ sādhyādyaṃgāpekṣayāt tadādhārānekattvena ca tatra 
yajanāṃgāni samādhirdhāraṇeti | samādhānaṃ samādhiryogāṃga 
vailakṣaṇyena dhāraṇā cetasobhimatapradeśo nirodhaḥ | 

tathā ca pataṃjaliḥ ||

deśabaṃdhaścittasya dhāraṇeti | dhyānamaṃtaryāgādanaṃtaraṃ tadarthaṃ vā 
hṛdādyekadeśe parameśvarādekāra ciṃtanam | tathā ca śārdhaśatatraye 
śrīmatkālottare | lalāṭe ceśvaraṃ dhyāyeditiḥ | japa upāṃśurmānasa ucyate | 
anabhipretasaṃkhyayā maṃtroccāraṇam | bhāvaḥ śuddhātmako bhaktyādiḥ |

<p. 1b> tayāṃsi prāṇāyāmādīni yaducyate | prāṇāyāmaḥ paraṃ tapaḥ 
athādhārāḥ svamūrtāvityādi | tatra kṛta sannidhāviti padaṃ 
svamūrtāvityādyānāṃ cala ityaṃtānāṃ pratyekamabhisaṃbadhyate | tatra 
sannidhikarṇapūrvasya yajanasyokta tvāt | yajanaṃ śreṣṭhametebhyo liṃga evetiḥ 
etebhyaḥ proktebhya ādhārebhyaḥ liṃgātmake viśiṣṭatare ādhāre yajanaṃ 
śobhanamityarthaḥ | tathā ca 

mahābhāratādau bhagavān vyāsamuniḥ | 

sarvarūpaṃ bhavaṃ jñātvā liṃge yorcayate prabhum |
tasminnabhyadhikāṃ prītiṃ karoti vṛṣabhadhvaja iti ||

kimātmakamiti | kiṃ prakṛti kiṃ kāraṇakam | vidhibhedāśca tadgatā iti 
liṃgaviṣayāni vidhānāṃtarāṇi brūhiti vakṣamāṇena saṃbaṃdhaḥ | āsthā 
pratiṣṭhā śubhāśāmāsthitamiti | iha śaivaśāstre 
pūrvapaścimottaraiśānīnāṃ catasṛṇāmeva diśāṃ śubhattvaṃ kāmye 
svānugamitiḥ | yathā kāmanārthānuguṇāyāṃ diśi sthitam |
yathā parasaṃtāpa cikīrṣurāgneyadigātaṃ yāyāt | maraṇacikīrṣuryāmya 
diksthaṃ rogādi vidhitsurnainṛta diksthamuccāṭana kṛdvāyavya diksthamiti yāvat | 

athācāryyalakṣaṇaṃ | daiśikottamaḥ | āryadeśasamudbhūtaḥ iti āryadeśaḥ 
yatra śāstrārtha vicāraḥ tasya ca samyaganuṣṭhānaṃ tatanudbhavo yasya tathā 
śuciriti parasvādāna nispṛhaḥ | 

tathā ca smṛti | yorthe śuciḥ saṃhi śuciḥ na mṛddāriśuciḥ śuciriti | 

dakṣa iti | svakarmaṇi dīkṣā vyākhyānādau sarvatra caturaḥ | 

samāhita iti | śrotriyonuṣṭhānā ca cīrṇācāryya vrata iti | 
ācāryyābhiṣekādanaṃtaraṃ śāstrāṃtaroktamācaritamācāryavrataṃ yena 
yathoktaṃ śrīmatsvāyaṃbhuve || 

athācāryyavrataṃ śreṣṭhaṃ caredācāryya eva hi |
pakṣadvayamadhaḥ śāyī nakrāśī carubhuk sadā ||

maunītriṣavaṇa snāyī ityādi | vidvāniti paṃḍito na mūrkhaḥ | yaduktamanyatra 

rājñobhrāptuḥ sa saṃdeho gururbhakti varjita | 

<p. 2a> iti | nakṣatre caṃdratārādītyādi |

prathamatṛtīyaṣaṣṭasaptamadaśamaikādaśasthānasthitattvānnakṣatrasya 
pariśuddhiḥ | yadāhu jyotiḥ śāstravidaḥ |

janmāśritastriṣaṣṭaśca saptamo daśamastathā |
ekādaśagato nṛṇāṃ caṃdraḥ sarvārtha sādhaka || 

iti tārājanma saṃpadyānavatābhyastṛtīyāpaṃcamīsaptamīnāṃ 
parityāgānnārāpariśuddhiḥ ādigrahaṇadyogapariśuddhepi 
kāladaṃḍādibhirekādaśabhirnā snāpyaśubhairvajite | yadutkaṃ 
śrīmatsvāyaṃbhuve || 

nāmnai vā coditānyogānekādaśaparityajediti |

anaya pluta iti | viṣṭi vṛhadvyatīpātādibhiravādite dāruṇogra cara ityādinā | 
dāruṇāni ādrāśleṣā jyeṣṭhāmūlānimāraṇādi karmasu | 

ugrāṇimaghābharaṇīti sraśca pūrvā śmaśānavetālādi siddhau | 
carāṇisvātipunarvasuśravaṇadhaniṣṭhāśatabhiṣaḥ uccānānādiṣu | 

kṣiprāṇi hastaḥ puṣyo'bhijidaśvinīkṣiprakāryyasādhane | 
dhruvāṇi rohiṇīti sraścottarā mokṣādi karmasu | mṛdūni 
citrānūrādhārevatīmṛgaśirāṃsi mṛdusvarūpakāryyāyaiva | lagne 
pūrvodayetyādi | meṣādi rāśināmeva lagna vyapadeśaḥ tasmin śīrṣodaye 
śīrṣodayāḥ ṣaṭ mithunasiṃhakanyātulakuṃbhavṛścikāḥ 
meṣavṛṣakarkaṭadhanimakarāḥ paṃca pṛṣṭhodayāḥ mīnastūbhayodayaḥ 
bhāvāstabudha na sahajā ityādyāḥ kālākhya puruṣasyāvayava sthānīyāḥ 
teṣāṃ samūhaścakraṃ | tasmin śuddhe tasya ca śuddhiritthaṃ yathā 
svamanukūlasthāneṣu grahāṇāmavasthitiḥ | yadāhuḥ 

jīvaḥ saptanavadvipākramagato vakrārkajau ṣaṭtrigau iti | sadaiśike iti 
navāṃśakādi kalpanayā yasya rāśeryasya navāṃśakasya śobhanatā tadyukto 
yathā meṣasya prathamanavāṃśako meṣāṃśaka eva karkaṭasyaivameva | 
prathamanavāṃśakarkaṭa saṃbaṃdhī sa ca tasya śobhanā iti | svasvāmītiḥ 
meṣādīnāṃ dvādaśānāṃ rāśīnāṃ krameṇādhipāḥ aṃgāra śukra(-) 

<p. 2b> budhacaṃdrārka budhaśukrabhaumagurusaurasauraguravaḥ 
kujaśukrajñeṃdurkajña kujajīva saurayamaguravobheśāḥ | tena dṛṣṭe grahasya 
ca darśanamevaṃ | yasmin sthāne graho vartate | tasmāddaśama tṛtīye dve sthāne 
dṛṣṭeścaturbhāgena paśyati | navama paṃcame ardha dṛṣṭyā | caturthāṣṭame 
pādatrayeṇa | saptamaṃ samagra dṛṣṭyai ca | yaduktaṃ tatraiva 

daśama tṛtīye navapaṃcame ca caturthāṣṭame kalatraṃ ca paśyaṃti phalāni 
caivaṃ prayacchaṃti iti | 

tatsuhṛditi | tatsuhṛdārāśīśvaramitreṇa vā dṛṣṭa ityarthaḥ | tatsuhṛdogne 
varāhamiharoktyaivoktāḥ iha tu sāmānyenocyaṃte |
sūryabhaumagurucaṃdrāścaṃdrasya sūryabudhaubhaumasya gurucaṃdrārkā 
budhasya raviśukrau guroḥ sūryyeṃdu bhaumāḥ |
śukrasya budhaśanaiścarau saurasya śukrabudhāvitiḥ | saumyavīkṣita iti | 
saumyagrahā budhaśukraguravaścaṃdrastu śuklapakṣe budhastu pāpayogāt 
pāpaḥ na punaḥ svataḥ yadapyāhuḥ | kṣīṇeṃdvarkayamārāḥ pāpāstaiḥ 
saṃyutaḥ saumya iti punarapi lagnaviśeṣaṇaṃ | 

vīryyavannara iti | vīryyavannaratvaṃ lagnasyetthaṃ | yadā svasvāmi yogaḥ 
somyagrahadarśanaṃ ca saumyagraheṇa vā yogaḥ svasvāmi vīkṣaṇaṃ ca | 
yaduktaṃ tatraiva 

adhipadyuto dṛṣṭo vā budhajīva nirīkṣitaśca yo rāśiḥ sa bhavati balavāniti | 

prasannamānase tryaṃśe iti | tryaṃśodrekkāṇābhidhānātmako jyotiḥ śāstre 
dṛṣṭo devatā viśeṣaḥ sa yasya rāśeḥ praharṣitaḥ | yaduktaṃ vṛhajjātake | 

bhūṣito varuṇavadvahuratnovaddhatūṇakavacaḥ sa dhanuṣkaḥ 
nṛttavādita kalāsu ca vidvān kāvyakṛtpiyunarāśāvasāne iti | anyacca 

gaurī sudhautāgradugūlahastāsamucchritā kuṃbhakaṭacchristāḥ devālayaṃ strī 
prayatāḥ pravṛttā vadaṃti kanyāṃtyagatastribhāga iti | tasmiṃstathā 
bhūterāśāviti | samānādhikaraṇyeṇaiva sapramo vyākhyeyā aprasannamāna 
sā drekkāṇāśca tatraiva nirdiṣṭāḥ teḥ graṃthagaurava bhayānna praharśitāḥ

<p. 3a> ratnabhāṃḍa samanvitaśca kasya cidrāśeḥ saṃbhavatyeva | yaduktaṃ 
tatraiva 

kinnaropamatanuḥ sa kaṃbalastūṇa cāpakavacaiḥ samanvitaḥ kuṃbhamudvahati 
ratnapūritaṃ sakṃdagaṃ makararāśi paścima iti | anyacca | 

surṇabhāṃḍa muktāmaṇi śaṃkhamiśrairvyākṣiptahastaḥ savibhūṣaṇaśca 
bhāryyāvibhūṣāya mahānidhānāṃnāvaṃ plava vyādhi gato jhaṣasyeti | 
tasmiṃstathā bhūte drekkāṇepi lagna iti sthitameva urjita iti drekkāṇayukte 
urjitaścokta eva tatra manuṣyavaktro śvasamānakāyo 
dhanurvigṛhyāyatamāśramasthaḥ kratūpayojyāni tapaśvinaścararakṣa 
pūurvodhanuṣastribhāga iti | kiṃ ca 

hayākṛtiḥ | 

pāṃḍuramālyaśekharobibhartti kṛṣṇājinamaṃbaraṃ naraḥ durāsadaḥ 
siṃhaduvānnakārmukonatāgnanāso mṛgarājamadhyama || 

iti evaṃ vidhorjita drekkāṇān mama karalagnā saṃbhave nirviṣā devā vā 
śabdāḥ pakṣāṃtare | viṣādarahita drekkāṇātmake vā gacchedityarthaḥ | 
saviṣādānāmapi tatraiva tatra saṃbhavāt | tathā ca | 

madmāśritā mūrdhani bhogi yuktāstrīkarkaśāraṇyagatāvirauti | śākhāṃ 
palāśasya samāśritā ca madhya sthitaḥ karkaṭakasya rāśeriti | anyacca |

udyāna saṃsthaḥ kavacīdhanuṣmān śarāstradhārīgaruḍānanaśca 
krīḍātmajālaṃ karaṇārtha ciṃtāṃ karoti madhye mithunasya cāyamiti | 
kṛtyanuge piveti | kartavya prayojanānurūpe vā siddhirayamarthaḥ | abhicārādi 
krūrakarma nimittaṃ tadarthātmaka drekkāṇayukte vā lagne tathā 
vidhārthasiddhirbhavatyeva tathā vidhāśca tatraivoddiṣṭāḥ śrutāṃtike sarpa 
viveṣṭitāṃgo vastrairvihīnaḥ puruṣastvaṭavyāṃ caurānalavyākulitāṃtarātmā 
vyākrośateṃ'tyopagato jhaṣasyeti | 

anyacca |

romacitomakaromapadaṃṣṭraḥ sūkarakāyasamānaśarīraḥ yoktṛkajā(-)

<p. 3b> lakabaṃdhanadhārī raudramukhomakaraḥ prathamastviti | 

kiṃ ca |

vibhīṣayaṃstiṣṭhati ratnacitrite vane mṛgān kāṃcanatūṇavarmabhṛt 
phalāmiṣairvānara rūpabhṛnnarastulāvasāne yavanairudāhṛta iti | 

anyacca |

śalmaleruparigṛddhrajaṃbukauśvānaraśca malināṃbarānvitaḥ |
rautimātṛpitṛviprayojitaḥ siṃharūpamidamayamucyate || 

ityevamātmakairevaṃ rūpāyāmevārthasiddhau yādyāditi prakṛtena saṃbaṃdha 
iti tryaṃśāyāvāṃ mukhīti rāśyardhasya horeti saṃjñā vyapadeśaḥ 
tasyāccordhvamukhatiryyaṅmudhomukhatvena triprakāratvaṃ | yadāhuḥ 

ūrddhvaṃ tiryyañvānatāsyā ca horeti | tatrorddhvamukhīyāraviṇopabhuktāyā 
tu tadadhiṣṭitā sā tiryyaṅmukhī yātu tenaiva kramaṇīyā sādho mukhī 
yadapyāhuḥ muktā krāṃtānāgatā ca krameṇeti tāsāṃ madhyānmukti 
nimittamūrddhvamukhīhittā praśastāyā saṃhitāṃtareṣvaṃgāriṇītyuktvā 
abhicārāryamadhomukhī yā dhūmeti tatra prasiddhā śākunoktyeti 
kapiṃvralakokila mayūrādi praśasta pakṣi virata śrutyāhitamabhimata 
phalapradaṃ śakunaṃ jñātvā śrutirapyāha | 

bhadraṃ purastānnovada bhadraṃ paścāt kapiṃjaleti | mahākavirapi kālidāsaḥ 
vāmaścāyaṃ vadati madhuraṃ cātaka iti | noktyeti | akasmādekajanasamuddhoṣita 
jayapuṇyāha kṣemādyuktyāvetiḥ | vikalpārthaḥ yā yādāyamya vā prāṇāniti | 
prāṇāpānāvāyamya dairghyaṃ nītvānubhavena 
vāmadakṣiṇanāsmaraṃdhrābhyāmanyatamena pravahaṇa jijñāsayā 
tajjijñāsāyāśca prayojanametat | yadi vāmaraṃdhravāhinaḥ 
prāṇāstadānukūlāḥ prokta śakunā saṃbhavepi yāyāt ityapi vikalpārthaḥ 
aśāṃtiṃ vidhāya gacchediti prakṛtena saṃbaṃdhaḥ |

atha śilāparikṣā |

snigdha dhvaniriti | avyaśabdāḥ snigdhā arūkṣāsitādyeti raktapītavarṇāstisropi

<p. 4a> brāhmaṇasya sitavarṇā tu brāhmaṇasya evaṃ kṣatriyasya pītakṛṣṇavarṇe 
raktā tu kṣatriyasya vaiśyaśudrā pekṣayai caitadavadhāraṇaṃ na tu 
brāhmaṇasyekṣayā tasya prāk tadviṣayā yā prāpte ruktatvāt | evamapi 
kṛṣṇavarṇā vaiśyasyai pītā tu vaiśyasyaiva kṛṣṇavarṇā tu 
śudrasyaityayamatrārthaḥ | uktaṃ ca 

śrīmatkāmike | 

etāścatasro viprasya tisro rājña ubhe diśaḥ |

ekāśudrasya niyamācchileti | gūḍhacchāyeti | gūḍhāgaṃbhīrācalācchāyā 
śobhā yasyāḥ siddhāvadhomukhīti | sādhanā liṃgacikīrṣayā budhnabhāge 
mukhalakṣmakartavyamityabhiprāyeṇa tatra lāṃcchanaṃ kuryāt | 
muktāvūrddhvamukhī uttānamukhī ūrddhva eva gamanaṃ muktiryato hīnarekhā 
bhavatīti hīnārekhāḥ sitavarṇāyā yadi raktāḥ pītā vā kṛṣṇā vā yadi 
bhavaṃti | tadā sā brāhmaṇasya neṣṭeti vakṣyamāṇena saṃbaṃdhaḥ | tathā ca 
śrīmatpiṃgalāmate | hīnarekhotamāhīneti | raktavarṇāyāḥ sitārekhā yadi 
bhavati | tatsā brāhmaṇa kṣatriyayoḥ śasyeta ityevamanyāsāmapi draṣṭavyam | 
yaduktaṃ tatraiva 

hīnarekhottamā śubhetiḥ gaureti sphaṭikānukārā ṭaṃkādi lohaśilpi 
bhāṃḍakṣayaṃkarī ca | uktaṃ ca paitāmahe | 

sphaṭikābhā bhavedgaurā bahulohakṣayaṃkarī |

kīlādṛḍhāṃ kuru śleṣā ūrmayaḥ jalataraṃgānukārārekhāsamūhāḥ 
puṭāśukti puṭākārā biṃdavo varṇātmakaḥ | prāguktarekhā saṃbaṃdhino 
bhāgaika deśāḥ vimalaiḥ pāṣāṇātmakairyā cānviteti kīlādināṃ pratyekaṃ 
yojyam duṣṭasatvānāṃ sarpavānaramakarādīnāmanukāro yasyāstadātāni 
śakalāni khaṃḍā yasyāḥ udaktasyā iti uttarasyāṃ tasyāḥ śilāyā diśi 
sthaṃḍile bhūmāneva pūjitaḥ śivabhaṭṭārako yenācāryeṇa sa tathā 
hutāgniriti kṛtāgnikāryyaḥ sādhāraṇena maṃtreṇeti sādhāraṇamaṃtrāḥ 
sapta | yaduktaṃ

<p. 4b> saṃhitāṃtare | 

praṇavo mātṛkāvyomavyāpī ṣaḍakṣaraḥ prasādo bahurūpaśca 
saptasādhāraṇāḥ smṛtā | iti ebhya ekena siddhyarthaṃ sādhyamaṃtreṇa 
śilpinaḥ tatkarmajīvinaḥ saṃśritavratāniti gṛhītā dhyavasāyān sahāyāniti 
gurusaṃbaṃdhinaḥ śiṣyān niyata iti vāṅmavasāsyāmavicaleṃdriyaḥ 
maheśaṃ dhyāyan | tathā svapnamānavakaṃ maṃtraṃ japan supyāt | 

sarvaryyate iti | rātryavasāne niścittaṃ svapnamiṣṭāmaniṣṭaṃ vā paśyati | 
garteti | yasyā deśāṃtareṣu dadhna iti dadhilābhastadabhakṣaṇaṃ ca te śreṣṭhe |
viṣṭāyāśceti | 

mūtrādīnāṃ malānāṃ lābhakṣaṇena śreṣṭhe viṣṭāvarjam vyajanaṃ 
tālavṛṃtādi vighnavarjitamitya saṃśayameva vidhibhaṃgāyeti vidhānavihataye 
kṛtakṛtya iti niṣprayojanaḥ ākoṭayediti | bhāgatraya kalpanayā 
cihnalekhābhirlāṃchana pūrvam svalpaṃ hanyāt brahmata iti brahmasthānāt 
muktya pekṣayā bhuktya pekṣayā tu rudra sthānāt yāna iti śakaṭādau 
tadadhiṣṭātrīmiti | vṛkṣādhiṣṭhāyi kāmīśvara śaktiṃ visṛjya sarvatra tasyāḥ 
sarvadā ca sannidhānādyaduktamanyatra | 

nasālabahulā kācit saṃtāna dvayavartinī |
vyāptrī śivakalā yasyāmadhiṣṭhātrī na vidyate || 

iti | tāṃ saṃvakṣa pūjyavakṣamāṇena ca maṃtreṇa visarjya vṛkṣa 
cidātmānaṃ ca nirodhya sa jīvasyaiva tasyopayogo papatteḥ sāravaditi 
sāradārutaye hatasya prasiddhiḥ kṣīradrumaḥ palāśādiḥ mādhuryya 
gaṃdhaguṇavadityādi | mādhuryyaguṇayuktājjātaṃ saubhāgyadam | 
gaṃdhaguṇayuktādvṛkṣaviśeṣādutyāditaṃ yattatkīrttidamityarthaḥ | surāhveti 
devadāruśāketi | śākābhidhāno vṛkṣaviśeṣaḥ | deśāṃtare prasiddha eva 
devadārvādibhirbilvāṃtairvṛkṣairyāni kriyaṃte tāni sarvapradānītyarthaḥ | 
piśācavṛkṣovibhītakābhidhānaḥ

