mānonmānāṃdīti | mānaṃ pārśva diśā unmānamūrddhvamāna 
ādigrahaṇāt pramāṇamapi sarvato'nohātmanā (*) kailamiti | tadabhipsitaṃ śailaṃ 
rūpaṃ navahastāṃtamuttamottamam | liṃgaṃ ca śabdāt pārthivaṃ śailaṃ 
proktamānenevonnamottamam | niṣviti puruṣaviṣayaṃ hitam | tryaṃśonamiti | ataḥ 
proktamānānnavahastātmakāttryaṃśenonaṃ dārujaṃ ṣaḍ 
hastamuttamottamamiti | vakṣyamāṇena saṃbaṃdhaḥ lohamasyārdheneti | 
asyānaṃtara proktasya ṣaḍ hastasyārdhena trihastaparimāṇena 
lohamayamuttamottamam | tadapyūnamiti | yadetaccatuṣprakṛtyunnamottamuktaṃ 
tadapi pratyekā pekṣayā tribhāgenonaṃ madhyamamuttamamiti |  
vakṣyamānenāgryaśabdenottamaśabdapratipādanaṃ yena tena śailaṃ ṣaḍ 
hastaṃ madhyamottamaṃ lohaṃ dvihastaṃ madhyamottamamiti | yāvat 
tadvikhaṃḍitamiti | caturṇāmapi saṃbaṃdhi madhyamottamaṃ mānaṃ 
dvikhaṃḍitaṃ kṛttvā kāvyāvasthayā tadardhamānataḥ kāvyasāgryam tena 
śailapārthive dvetrihaste madhyamottame dārujaṃ dvihastaṃ lohaṃ 
hastamityarthaḥ | tribhāgaiḥ svairiti etānyeva trīṇi trīṇi liṃgāni pratiprakṛtiyāni 
tāni svaiḥ svaistribhāgaiḥ navadhā navadhābhidyaṃte | ayamarthaḥ |

<p. 5b> uttamottama liṃgāpekṣayāmadhyamottamasya tribhāgatvaṃ 
tattribhāgānumānapātata uttamottamamadhyamottamakanyamottamebhyaḥ 
anyaliṃga ṣaṭkaṃ bhavatītiḥ | itthaṃ svaistribhāgairnavadhābheda utpadyate | tena 
śailapārthivaprakṛtīnāṃ hastāt prabhṛti navahatāṃ taṃ yāvat | 
navanavasthitānyeva 
dārujasyottamottamānmānā ṣoḍaśāṃgulānupātenāṃtarā madhya kanyasaṃ 
yāvaccatvāri liṃgāni bhavaṃti | pūrveḥ sahevaṃ saptakanyasāgryādadho 
dvetadvadevānye evaṃ navamṛgeṃdrepi dārujaṃ liṃgaṃ 
parvabhiḥ ṣoḍaṣāṃgulairiti | evamapi lohasyāṣṭāṃgulānupātena | 

tatrāpyuktaṃ | lohaṃ karottamaṃ bhāgairvasusaṃkhyairavāṃtaramiti | evaṃ 
hastamānaliṃgānyuktvā pūrvaniṣpanna prāsādamānenocyaṃte 
prāsādagarbhamānādityādi | vakṣyamāṇānāṃ 
caturhastādi ṣaṭtriṃśaddhastāṃtānāṃ navānāṃ prāsādānāṃ pratyekaṃ 
garbhamānād bhavaṃti | iti vikalpamānavidhiḥ daśāyi paṃcavṛddhānāṃ 
sādhāratvena vakṣyamāṇatvaditadanupayogaḥ evaṃ prākṛtābhi 
pretaprāsādagarbhapaṃcabhāgatrayeṇonnamottamaṃ | tathā 
navabhāgapaṃcakena madhyamamadhyamaṃ vakṣyamāṇavāṃtara bhedaśruteḥ 
tathaiva tadagarbhārthena kanyasam | taccatayaiva śrutyā 
kanyasakanyasaṃbhaviṣyati | tadavāṃtarabhedenetyādi | teṣāṃ trayāṇāṃ ye 
avāṃtare madhyapradeśe dvau tatra bhedaḥ sūtratrayadā vādinā tena ṣaḍ 
liṃgāni uttamamadhyama uttamakanyasamadhyamajyeṣṭhāmadhyamakanya 
sakanyasottamamadhyamābhidyunāni bhavaṃtītyevaṃ pratiprāsādaṃ 
garbhamānā ivaliṃgāni eṣa evārthaḥ |

śrīmatkiraṇādāvuktaḥ | 

garbhavān kanyasaṃliṃgaṃ paṃcabhāge kṛte sati |
tribhiḥsyāduttamaṃ liṃgaṃ navadhā bhājite sati ||

<p. 6a> paṃcabhirmadhyamaṃ liṃgaṃ bhavenmadhyamamadhyamam |
tadūrdhvādho bhavedgarbho bhājyāṃśaiḥ sa tribhistribhiḥ ||

evaṃ garbhe yathāyogaṃ liṃgāni navasaṃkhyayeti |

jyeṣṭhajyeṣṭhāditi pradipāditayopapatyā bahuttvepi liṃgānāmidaṃ 
jyeṣṭhajyeṣṭhaṃ jyeṣṭhamadhyaṃ jyeṣṭhakanyasaṃ 
madhyamajyeṣṭhamityevamātmakena bhedena navaivana bahūni ityarthaḥ | 
jyeṣṭhādi vyapadeśa iti | yoyaṃ jyeṣṭhajyeṣṭhādi vyapadeśaḥ sa 
liṃgāpekṣayā prāsādāviṣayopi sthita eva tatra vakṣamāṇa 
caturhastādi ṣaṭatriṃśaddhastāṃtānāṃ navānāṃ liṃgo yānenaiva 
vakṣyamāṇa yuktyāpi siddhitaḥ sthito yathā navahastasya liṃgasya 
mānādhikyāduttamottamasya ṣaṭtriṃśaddhasta uttamottama eva prāsādaḥ evaṃ 
hastamānasya kanyasakanyasasya caturhastaḥ prāsādaḥ kanyasakanyasaḥ sthita 
eveti siddham | garbhamānaliṃgāpekṣayā tu pratiprāsādaṃ jyeṣṭhādi 
vyapadeśo navātmakepi niviṣṭhaḥ | 

ayamarthaḥ | 

yopi vakṣyamānena pramāṇena ṣaṭtriṃśaddhastaḥ prāsādastasyāpi 
svagarbhamānāt kanyasakanyasa liṃgāśrayatvena kanyasakanyasatvamevamapi 
caturhastasya garbhamānamuttamottamaliṃgāśrayatvenottamottamatvamityartha 
siddham | prāsādebhyaśca liṃgānāmiti | prāguktānuvādaḥ pīṭhānāṃ ceti | ca 
śabdātpīṭhānāmapi prāsādebhyaḥ jyeṣṭhādivyapadeśaḥ tathā te naivārthena 
śabda vaicitryāt prāsāda garbhādeva pīṭhamānaṃ pratipādayati śarāṃśa 
tritayenāgryamiti tayormadhyeneti tayoruttamottamayoḥ kanyasakanyasayormadhyena 
madhyamapramāṇena madhyamapramāṇena madhyama

<p. 6b> madhyamaṃ pīṭhaṃ bhavatīti vākyaśeṣaḥ yalliṃgavidhāvuktaṃ 
navāṃśaiḥ paṃcabhirmadhyamamiti | tadanyānīti | tebhyaḥ anyāni ṣaṭliṃgavat 
pīṭhāni yathāpūrvaṃ liṃgatrayamuktvā tadavāṃtarabhedenānyāni ṣaṭ 
utpāditāni tathaiva pīṭhānītyarthaḥ | liṃgāyati pramāṇānīti | yadyapi 
śarāṃśa tritayenāgryamiti | etena pīṭhamānaṃ pratipāditam tathāpi 
vakṣyamāṇa liṃgamānena prasādaviṣayamidaṃ tatrayā 
liṃgasyāyatirdairghyaṃ tatpramāṇena visṛtam pīṭham yāvalliṃgasya 
dīrghatvaṃ tāvatpīṭhasya vistara iti ucchritoragre vakṣyamāṇa tvāt avyakta 
mukhaliṃgānāṃ samaṃ viplvaṃti kocchrayam 
vyakteścāsadṛśāyāmaṃtardhocchrāya vistaram | ityetena jyeṣṭha madhyādika iti 
tulyaphalatvena jyeṣṭhādi bhedo niḥprayojanaḥ syāt phalabheda vivakṣyayā tu 
jyeṣṭhamadhyādi bhedataḥ | yaduktaṃ 

pratiṣṭhā pārameśvare || 

aṃgabhūyastvayastvataḥ proktaṃ phalabhūyastvamatratviti | 

ihāpi vakṣyate | pratiṣṭhāliṃgavedināṃ yāvaṃtaḥ paramāṇavaḥ 
tāvadvarṣasahasrāṇi kartubhogabhujaḥ phalamiti | parāpare bhuktimuktī iti | 
parābhuktiḥ śuddhaviddhā tu navabhogaḥ aparā tu 
rasarasāyanavivarasādhanādikā tathaiva parāmuktiḥ śivasaṃmatā aparā tu 
vidyāvidyeśatvaṃ | tathā ca 

tattvasaṃgrahe ||

guruḥ sadyo jyotirvidyā vidyeśatvaṃ tvaparāmuktiḥ pareha śiva samateti | te 
parāpare bhuktimukti phalaṃ śastrapramāṇakam | śāstraparidṛṣṭamityarthaḥ | 
mahānīleti | iṃdranīlaḥ vajraṃ vajramaṇiḥ heruka iti prasiddhiḥ evamātmake 
liṃgena jyeṣṭhādi vibhāgaḥ yo yasmāt sarvaguṇānāṃ prāsādānāṃ 
pīṭhānāṃ sādhāraṇamanuguṇaṃ tadityarthaḥ | bāṇaliṃge svayaṃ vyakte 
ityādi bāṇaliṃgasya svayaṃbhuvaśca sarvapīṭhāśrayatvepi

<p. 7a> viśeṣāṃtaraṃ sādhyapūrveti | sādhyārdhaṃ saṃpūjya pūrvaṃ 
tadvisarjanādanaṃttaraṃ maṃtrāṃtaraniveśanānna 
kadācinmaṃtrasaṃkaradoṣaḥ svayaṃ vyaktabāṇaliṃgaviṣayamevaitadvacanam 
yatonyatramaṃtrasaṃkaraḥ saṃbhāvyate eva liṃgaśabdenetyādi | 
samastapadārthānāṃ sṛṣṭisaṃhārakāraṇatvena citrī karaṇahetu 
yattalliṃgaśabdena paṃḍitāḥ prāhuḥ niruktadaśāpi teṣāmeva bhāvānāṃ 
saṃhāre tatraiva layanāt sṛṣṭisamaye'ta evāgamanaṃ tasmācca tacca padaṃ 
sthānamavyayamavināśi na tu yathā prākṛtairanyailiṃgaśabdena ucyate | itthaṃ 
tādṛśasya bhagavato yā saṃjñā sa tadīyaḥ śabdaḥ anaṃtarodite pratipādite 
vakṣyamāṇa pramāṇarūpaiḥ pratipādyamāne ca tasyā vyayasya padasya 
tatrastha vyakti sthānatā tayā hetubhūtayā tadīya śabdobhākta upacarita 
ityarthaḥ | trividhaṃ taditi vakṣyamāṇaprakāreṇa tattriprakāram tayādhṛti 
mukhaliṃgaṃ | liṃgāyāmeti ||

liṃgasya yaccikīrṣita māyāmodairghyaṃ tasya ṣoḍaśabhāgakalpanayā 
caturbhirbhūtasavyaiḥ paṃcabhirvārasaiḥ ṣaḍbhirvā viṣkaṃbhaḥ pṛthutvam eṣa 
ca viṣkaṃbhaḥ sādhanā liṃga vakṣyamāṇa lokapāla liṃgātmakaṃ tyaktvā 
teṣāṃ pratyekaṃ svāvasara eva taduktaiḥ itthaṃ māyāmaviṣkaṃbhayukte 
tasminnarthāṃśca tāvatparimāṇake caturdikṣu pariṇāhamāne siddhe 
adhobhāgasya brahmabhāgātmanaścaturaśratāsiddhaiva 
madhyamabhāgavartanārthaṃ tatkarṇārdhetaratyāgāditi | taditi 
caturaśraparāmarśaḥ caturaśrasya yatkarṇakoṇa dvayaṃ sūtraniveśanena 
vyajyate | taduktaṃ cānyatra 

koṇātkoṇāyataṃ sūtraṃ karṇa ityabhidhīyate |

iti tasyārdhena caturaśrotpādanasūtrāṇāṃ caturdikṣu 
sthitānāmaṣṭalāṃcchanapātāditarārdha tyāgādaṣṭāsramutpādayediti śeṣaḥ 
aṣṭāśratotpādanāyāparovidhiḥ

<p. 7b> tasmiṃścaturaśre munibhājite saptavibhakte pratikoṇaṃ 
bhāgamaparihāryyetyādi | bhāgadvaya parivarjanena vā tadaṣṭāśraṃ kuryyāt | 
tadūrdhvaṃ aṣṭāśrādūrdhvayo rudrabhāgastaṃ brahmasthānānmadhya 
pradeśāt parito bhrameṇa vṛttatāṃ parivartulatvaṃ nayet | aśrilopa krameṇa 
vṛttatāṃ nayet | vṛttatot pādanāyāpi prakārāṃtaram | aṣṭā 
asyaiva ṣoḍaśāśrityotpādanapūrvaṃ dvātriṃśadaśripradarśana krameṇa vā 
śrilopakramo bhavet tacca śirovṛttyā śiro vartanā prakārai cchattrādibhiraneka 
vidham chatrasyaiva caturvidhatvaṃ kāṣṭhāṃśakasya śirasaḥ yo sāvaṣṭāṃśa 
tasmin kāṣṭāṃśake caturbhirbhājite satiḥ prathamadvitīya tṛtīyacaturthabhāga 
bhāgavivartanato yatha saṃkhyaṃ puṃḍrakādyāścatvāra chatrabhedā bhavaṃti 
| bhinnaphala prāptyarthe | kukkuṭāṃḍaṃ tu śirasaścaturthabhāga parivartanataḥ 
trapusākṛti śirasa eva ṣaḍbhāgavartanāt | tasyaiva mūrdhnastribhāgavartanena 
bālacaṃḍa saṃjñakam | etyevaṃ saptaprakārāyāḥ 
śirovartanāyāstriprakāreṇa viṣkaṃbhabhedena sahaika viṃśati guṇitāni 
prāguktāni yāni pratiprāsādaṃ navanavaliṃgāni sādhāraṇavidhāviti | etāni 
sādhāraṇavidhau mokṣa nimittamarcayitvā daivapradhānāḥ svaṃ 
svamātmīyamabhimataṃ sthānaṃ prāptā iti | tathānyatameti | daśadiśāmanyata 
māyā diśaḥ svāmyasiddhaye lokapālārcitaṃ śatṝṇāṃ vā staṃbhatāpa 
vidveśādi nimittaṃ yalliṃgamiti pūrveṇaiva saṃbaṃdhaḥ tatkṛṇuta | atha 
lokapālaliṃgāni caturbhirdheti | ardhaṣaḍbhāga catuṣṭayena viṣkaṃbhosya 
brahmabhāgaṃ evamāyāmaṃ dvādaśadhā kṛtvā tattribhāgena sthaulyaṃ 
śāstrāṃtarokta sarvasamaliṃgasyaiva | yaduktaṃ 

śrīmatpratiṣṭhāparameśvare | 

sthaulyaṃ dairghyaṃ tribhāgena liṃge syāt sarvataḥ sama |

<p. 8a> iti | madhyamaṣṭāśramādivat iti | mokṣaliṃgoktavadityarthaḥ | 
prāgvadvṛttaṃ ceti vṛttaṃ rudrabhāgaḥ prāgvadeva kiṃtve talliṃgamaiṃdraṃ 
śatrumardanābhidhānāt | chatraśiraḥ pūrvapaścimayordvaye tadvayena | 
saumyayāmyayorekaikayā | evamaśriṣṭkena ca samanvitam | paṃcabhiḥ svardheti | 
